Work on your exercises for a bit.

567
00:40:05,199 --> 00:40:06,719
Focus. Don't be careless.

568
00:40:06,719 --> 00:40:07,880
I'm going to the restroom.

569
00:40:27,360 --> 00:40:29,760
Can you draw a portrait for Grandpa?

570
00:40:30,400 --> 00:40:31,679
Am I drawing you, Grandpa?

571
00:40:31,719 --> 00:40:32,840
No, not me.

572
00:40:32,840 --> 00:40:34,039
Draw someone else.

573
00:40:34,039 --> 00:40:37,320
His face is rather square.

574
00:40:38,199 --> 00:40:40,920
His eyes are a bit small and squinty.

575
00:40:41,159 --> 00:40:42,320
Squinty eyes.

576
00:40:42,320 --> 00:40:44,000
He has big bags under his eyes.

577
00:40:44,239 --> 00:40:46,000
His ears are bigger than mine.
